{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25244","headline":"咏子规 · 蔡京","name":"咏子规","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年冤魄化爲禽，永逐悲风叫远林。\n愁血滴花春艳死，月明飘浪冷光沈。\n凝成紫塞风前泪，惊破红楼梦里心。\n肠断楚词归不得，劒门迢遰蜀江深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡京","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}